@startuml
title TASK-260712-30abcm - macOS microphone capture outcome

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor User
component "Record UI\n(later integration task)" as UI
component "MacMicrophoneCaptureEngine\nserial lifecycle owner" as Owner
component "TCC authorizer" as TCC
component "MacAVAudioCaptureBackend\nCoreAudio + AVAudioEngine" as Backend
component "Start/stop cue events" as Cue
component "Main-program ducker\n-12 dB" as Duck
component "Local RMS meter" as Meter
database "CaptureMediaStore\nprivate partial -> one draft" as Store
component "Upload service\n(later task)" as Upload

User --> UI : explicit Record / Stop / Cancel
UI --> Owner : begin / cue completed / terminal action
Owner --> TCC : request only after Record
Owner --> Backend : default or selected input
Backend --> Owner : mono 48 kHz samples\nor device failure
Owner --> Cue : start before commit\nstop after finalization
Owner --> Duck : capture active / inactive
Owner --> Meter : committed samples only
Owner --> Store : PCM16 WAV\n180 s and 50 MiB caps
Store ..> Upload : durable handle only;\nno automatic network path

note bottom of Owner
Generation token rejects late TCC grants.
Unsafe terminal paths close and delete partials:
cancel, loss, revoke, sleep, lock, quit, failure.
No AEC/noise-suppression claim.
end note

@enduml
